   "subject": "epochvalues2csv question",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">I have the epochvalues2csv set to TRUE, because I want to pull out some segments during a particular day (say, 12:00 to 2:00) and find the mean ENMO during that time (for example, using Excel).<div><br></div><div>When I look at the epoch csv file that is produced — the ENMO values are very low, e.g over an entire day it only ranges &lt;0.005 to 4.8 with a mean of 0.0352. This does not compare at all to the mean_ENMO_mg_0-24hr in the part2_daysummary of 59.96 for that day.</div><div><br></div><div>What am I missing?<br><div>\r\n<div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><br>Graydon Raymer R.Kin, PhD</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;word-wrap:break-word\">Director, School of Physical and Health Education<br>Room 201F, Centre for Physical and Health Education</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font